# Automation-VMs SSH hardening — drop-in for /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/
# Applied by provisioning/ssh.sh → 99-automation-alchemy.conf
#
# Review / private-network access: devops only.
# Vagrant NAT SSH (source 10.0.2.0/24): also allow vagrant so `vagrant ssh` works.
# See docs/decisions.md.

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
X11Forwarding no

AllowUsers devops

Match Address 10.0.2.0/24
	AllowUsers devops vagrant
